                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-success">v2.0.0 — Balance</div>
                    <div class="small text-muted">ACID Workflows, Reconciliation Service</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-success">v3.0.0 — Snapshot</div>
                    <div class="small text-muted">Backup/Restore, CSV & JSON Export/Import</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-success">v4.0.0 — Chronicle</div>
                    <div class="small text-muted">Database Dictionary & Mermaid Diagrams</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-success">v5.0.0 — Replica</div>
                    <div class="small text-muted">Read/Write Separation & Replica Health</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-light">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-success">v6.0.0 — Shard</div>
