                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="border rounded p-3 h-100 bg-primary text-white">
                    <div class="fw-bold fs-6">v7.0.0 — Capital</div>
                    <div class="small opacity-75">Logistic Regression Credit Risk Model & RFM Customer Segmentation</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
